  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "おや、少年。奇遇じゃないか、こんなところで会うなんて。きみもどこか怪我をしたのかい？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_laugh-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "ふむ。保健委員の手伝いをしにきた……ねぇ？　殊勝な心がけだ。次は図書委員の仕事でも手伝ってもらおうかな♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "あぁ、私はここで本を読んでいるんだ。けさからどうにも体調が悪くてね、体の節々が痛いのだよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "体調不良の原因には、おおよそ見当がついているよ。昨晩からずっと読書をしていてね、寝不足で疲れが抜けなかったのだろうさ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/sad2",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "おかげで腰が痛くてね……。こうやって半身を起こして読書をしているだけでも、すこし大変なくらいなんだ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/angry1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_angry-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "おっと。勝手にマッサージをしようとしないでくれ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/angry2",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "素人が付け焼き刃の知識で医療行為をしようだなんて言語道断だよ。もし私の腰が一生治らなくなってしまったらどうするんだい？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "責任を取る？　無責任なことを言うね、君は。私が要介護状態になったら一生を添い遂げてくれるとでも言うのかい？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/angry2",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_angry-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "愛というのはそんなに甘いものではないと思うがね。責任感から生じた『無償の愛』なんてものはメサイアコンプレックス由来のものであると私は断じるよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "献身的なのは助かるけど、あまり突飛な行動には出ないでほしい。これは君のためでもある"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "言ってる意味がわからない？　ふむ。すこし小難しい言い回しになっていたかもしれないね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "つまるところ、君のせいで私が怪我をしてしまったなら、お互いに面倒な結末になるということさ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "sigh",
    "position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "それでも放っておけないときたか。では、お茶でも淹れてもらおうかな。本を読むのはすこし休憩にして、ゆっくり休んでいるとしよう"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "……しかし、こうやって保健室のベッドにいると、むかし、病気がちだったころのことを思い出すね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/58/emo_response-3.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "うん。子供のころは、とくに病弱でね。友達なんてほとんどいなくて、読書が友達のようなものだったよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "長期入院したときに、病院から出られなかった私は、物語によって外の世界を知った。本はなんでも教えてくれたんだ"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "さまざまな冒険譚を伝え聞くように、いろんなことを教えてもらった"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 470
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "私の両親は過保護すぎるけれど、それゆえに私が本をねだると、たくさんの書籍を買ってくれたものだよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
